    "key": "D",
    "content": "$x^{2} - 5x + 6$",
    "correct": true,
    "rationale": "Correct: $(x - 1)\\left(x^{2} - 5x + 6\\right) = x^{3} - 6x^{2} + 11x - 6$."
   }
  ],
